                <pb facs="0025" n="XXI" xml:id="pgXXI"/>

                <head>List of Short Titles</head>
                <p rendition="#flush">Acheson, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Present at the Creation:</hi>
                    Dean Acheson, <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Present at the Creation: My Years in the State Department</hi>, New York:
                    W.W. Norton Company, Inc., 1969.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">AFP: Basic Documents:</hi> United
                    States Department of State, <hi rendition="#italic">American Foreign Policy,
                        1950–1955: Basic Documents</hi>, 2 vols., Washington: Government Printing
                    Office, 1957.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">Cmd 8425: <hi rendition="#italic">Correspondence between His
                        Majesty’s Government in the United Kingdom and the Persian Government, and
                        Related Documents concerning the Oil Industry in Persia, February 1951 to
                        September 1951</hi>, Persia No. 1 (1951), London: Her Majesty’s Stationery
                    Office, Cmd. 8425.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Documents</hi> (R.I.I.A.) for 1951:
                        Denise Folliott, ed., <hi rendition="#italic">Documents
                        on International Affairs, 1951</hi>, Royal Institute of International
                    Affairs, London: Oxford University Press, 1954.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">Eden, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Full Circle: Sir Anthony
                            Eden, The Memoirs of Anthony
                            Eden, Full Circle</hi>, Boston: Houghton Mifflin Company,
                    1960.</p>
